            "text": "New stays in Santolla (7/29, state) and McDonald v. Katz (7/24, federal) hold Virginia's bans unenforceable until 60 days after SCOTUS decides Viramontes/Grant — sales continue statewide. NJ hits T-1 with AG guidance still unposted.",
            "wrap": true,
